  "description": "In a battle with the imperial knights, as the hero of the enemy mercenary Hernandez Bangador, he is resourceful and favored by the first princess of the empire, so he is called an imperial knight. The story unfolds when the first princess takes the protagonist to try on Da Vinci's plate armor, and was met by an enemy attack.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/53411531), [MComics](https://www.mcomics.co.kr/webtoonComic/5901), [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/845017207), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/comic/seoulcm_0143), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=4343490), [Mootoon](https://www.mootoon.co.kr/comic/moo_list.mg?tcode=w7qh)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/65254), [French](https://www.ono.live/webtoon/clockwork-empire), [German](https://www.lezhinde.com/detail/dad_0010049), [Thai](https://www.wecomics.in.th/comics/16341/)",
